Z||000012||Archie||10-14-2001||09:42 AM||||Well Chad, I think you sould trade back to the Fiero.<P>I wonder out loud if the Miata world has something like PFF that isn't sponsored by some business. <P>I know some auto makes have Forums that are put up by Vendors who have a vested interest in that marque. On many of those lists you get advertizing at the bottom of each post etc. and you are restricted from posting your own items for sale & from recommending other vendors (if the other Vendor is not the Forum Sponsor).<P>WE members of PFF don't have to put up with that crap.<P>I'm always looking to read about cars and I'd like to join a few other (non-Fiero) Forums, just so I can see what others' are doing. However, I have yet to find one that is totally open like this one and that uses the "Good" software like Cliff uses.<P>Cliff has spoiled us.<P>Archie||||reg||1
